    "# \ud83d\ude80 ComfyUI + LTX 2.3 GGUF \u2014 Multi-Scenario Video Generator\n",
    "\n",
    "**T\u00e1c gi\u1ea3:** Hermes Agent (Qu\u00e2n \u0110\u00e0m)  \n",
    "**Base:** wandaweb/ComfyUI-Kaggle + Isi-dev/Google-Colab_Notebooks + Lightricks/ComfyUI-LTXVideo  \n",
    "**Model:** Unsloth LTX-2.3-GGUF Dynamic 2.0\n",
    "\n",
    "## \ud83c\udfac C\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i video c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o\n",
    "\n",
    "| Lo\u1ea1i | Workflow | M\u00f4 t\u1ea3 |\n",
    "|------|----------|------|\n",
    "| **Text\u2192Video** | T2V Single Stage | Prompt \u2192 video thu\u1ea7n |\n",
    "| **\u1ea2nh\u2192Video** | I2V Single Stage | \u1ea2nh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u2192 video motion |\n",
    "| **Ng\u01b0\u1eddi tham chi\u1ebfu** | ICLoRA HDR | Gi\u1eef m\u1eb7t nh\u00e2n v\u1eadt t\u1eeb \u1ea3nh g\u1ed1c |\n",
    "| **Ng\u01b0\u1eddi + S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m** | ICLoRA Ingredients | Nhi\u1ec1u \u1ea3nh tham chi\u1ebfu c\u00f9ng l\u00fac |\n",
    "| **C\u1ea7m s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m** | ICLoRA Union Control | \u1ea2nh ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u1ea7m s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u2192 video |\n",
    "| **Lip sync** | ICLoRA Lipdub | Video + audio \u2192 lip sync |\n",
    "| **Video\u2192Video** | V2V ICLoRA | Bi\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed5i video g\u1ed1c |\n",
    "| **Inpaint/Outpaint** | ICLoRA Inpaint/Outpaint | S\u1eeda/m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng video |\n",
    "\n",
    "## \u2699\ufe0f C\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh Kaggle\n",
    "- **Accelerator:** GPU T4 x2 (khuy\u00ean d\u00f9ng) ho\u1eb7c P100  \n",
    "- **Internet:** B\u1eacT  \n",
    "- **Persistence:** Files only\n"
   ]
  },
