    "## \ud83d\udccb H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Workflows\n",
    "\n",
    "### Cho t\u1eebng lo\u1ea1i video:\n",
    "\n",
    "| B\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n | Workflow | C\u1ea7n chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb |\n",
    "|----------|----------|-------------|\n",
